#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows the simulated vehicle with a camera sensor traveling on a road with forward traffic in two lanes and oncoming traffic in a third lane.
#
#The camera sensor's image information is passed to Simulink, and headway distance and number of other cars are detected by an image processing. The minimum supported Matlab version is R2014b. The Computer Vision System Toolbox is also required.
#
#In this example, speed control is provided used ACC with a built-in sensor.
#
#A CarSim Sensors license is required to run this simulation.  However, the license is not needed to view results.
#
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

